        "acc_description": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Description",
            "icon_style": "description",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/accordion-desc.png",
            "content": "<p>Brisa is a non-electronic sensory habit device with replaceable aroma cores, built for the moments your hands and mouth expect something.</p><p>Snap a core in, twist the base to set your airflow (tighter or looser, however you like to draw) and draw. You get bold flavour, a cooling throat feel and the hand-to-mouth ritual, in a device with a familiar weight in your hand.</p><p>The body is anodised aluminium, laser-engraved and weighted to feel substantial. Only the cores are replaced.</p><p>No battery, no charging, no e-liquid, no heating, no buttons. No nicotine, no tobacco, no smoke, no vapour.</p><p>Brisa is a sensory experience, not a treatment. What you do with it is yours.</p>"
          }
        },
        "acc_ingredients": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Ingredients",
            "icon_style": "ingredients",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/accordion-ingred.png",
            "content": "<p>Every Brisa core is built from three things: a food-grade fibre core, food-grade aroma compounds and our cooling effect layer, which gives that crisp, cool feel at the back of the throat.</p><p>Air is drawn through the core and carries the flavour and the cooling feel. Nothing is burned, heated or charged.</p><p>No nicotine, no tobacco, no e-liquid, no battery, no smoke, no vapour.</p><p>Each core lasts up to 2-3 days. Mint tends to last longest and some fruit flavours fade sooner, because aroma fades with air exposure. Keep unused cores sealed until you need them.</p><p>The exact blend stays ours, but ask us anything about what's in it and a real person replies.</p>"
          }
        },
        "acc_subscription": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Subscription",
            "icon_style": "subscription",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/accordion-sub.png",
            "content": "<p>Never run out of cores. Add a core subscription at checkout and your cores arrive on repeat, priced below one-off packs, with free shipping.</p><ul><li>Your choice: the subscribe option is never ticked for you.</li><li>Skip, pause, change or cancel any time from your account. No lock-in, no fees.</li><li>Cancel before your next billing date and you won't be charged.</li><li>It renews automatically until you cancel. Your price, schedule and currency are shown at checkout before you pay, and we email a reminder before every renewal.</li><li>Cores only. The device is a one-time purchase.</li></ul><p>Your first subscription order is covered by our 30 Day Guarantee.</p>"
          }
        },
        "acc_shipping": {
          "type": "accordion",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Shipping, returns & guarantee",
            "icon_style": "shipping",
            "icon": "shopify://shop_images/accordion-ship.png",
            "content": "<p><strong>Shipping</strong> Free shipping on every kit. Orders dispatch within 1-2 business days with tracking. After dispatch, delivery usually takes: Australia 6-10 days, New Zealand 6-10 days, UK 5-7 days, US 7-14 days. Orders outside Australia are delivered duty paid, so you pay nothing extra on delivery.</p><p><strong>30 Day Guarantee</strong> Brisa not hitting right in your first 30 days after delivery? Message us on Instagram or email admin@brisabetter.com with your order number, flavour, days used and what feels off. A real person replies, builds you a personal plan to dial in your flavour and airflow, and sends 6 free cores (2 packs). Faulty, damaged? We replace or refund it, always. Your rights under Australian Consumer Law are never affected.</p><p><strong>Changed your mind?</strong> Unopened kits with the hygiene seal intact can be returned within 30 days of delivery for a refund of the product price. Email us first for approval. Return postage is at your cost, and shipping, duties and import taxes aren't refunded. Brisa is used in or near the mouth, so once the seal is broken we can't accept change-of-mind returns. The seal protects the next person.</p>"
          }
        }
      },
