    "device_questions_PFtKdK": {
      "type": "device-questions",
      "blocks": {
        "q1": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Will it actually satisfy me?",
            "answer": "<p>Most people expect nothing special. Then they take the first draw. Brisa is built around bold flavour and a cooling throat feel, plus the hand-to-mouth ritual, minus the nicotine. It's a different experience to smoke or vapour, and everyone's different, so give it a few draws and twist the base to set your airflow. Not landing in your first 30 days? Message us and we'll help you dial it in your flavour, your airflow, suggestions and what's worked for other Brisa customers, and send you free cores to try. We are very hands on when it comes to advice so please reach out.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q2": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What exactly is Brisa?",
            "answer": "<p>Brisa is a non-electronic device with a replaceable aroma core. No battery, no e-liquid, no heating, no vapour. Nothing is powered or produced. Air is drawn through the core, carrying flavour and a cooling feel. Brisa is designed around the routine and familiarity's. No smoke, no vapour and no lingering smell, so it's easy to use around people. Always.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q3": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What's actually in a Brisa core?",
            "answer": "<p>Every core is built from three things: a food-grade fibre core, food-grade aroma compounds (similar to what you find in food and drink) and our cooling effect layer. Nothing is burned, heated or charged. No nicotine, no tobacco, no e-liquid. The exact blend stays ours, but ask us anything about what's in it and a real person replies.</p>"
          }
        },
        "q4": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How long does a core last?",
            "answer": "<p>Each core lasts up to 2-3 days. Mint tends to last longest, and some fruit flavours fade faster, because aroma fades with air exposure. Make sure to keep unused cores sealed and close the pack after every use. Swap the cores out as you need to, you may get longer out of a core than suggested, all depending on your preference. Cores are the only ongoing cost. Make sure to time it correctly if you need to order again so your not running out mid journey to stop your habit.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_7QFghX": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "How is it different to gums, patches or a plain air inhaler?",
            "answer": "<p>A plain air inhaler gives you the motion and little else. Gums and patches don't give your hands anything to do, and can stick out and be off-putting in social scenes plus they contain nicotine. Brisa gives you the hand-to-mouth ritual with a cooling throat feel and bold flavour, that familiar routine, you won't stick out all with zero nicotine.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_DXhh7a": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What's the best way to use Brisa?",
            "answer": "<p>Go all in. Brisa feels best when you stop dipping in and out and make it your go-to. Every time your hands and mouth expect something (when your about to slip up), reach for Brisa: the coffee, the drive, the after-dinner moment, the break at work. Swap the moment, then move on. Flavour can feel milder at first than you're used to as your old habit damages your taste buds, so don't judge it on one draw. Give it a few days of real use, try more than one flavour, and twist the base until the draw feels right. Swap in a fresh core when the flavour fades, and close the pack after every use.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_yzU3fM": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "What's the device made of?",
            "answer": "<p>A intentionally weighted, anodised aluminium body with a laser-engraved finish, built to last, built to blend in, built to be familiar. Only the cores are replaced.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_rMCimq": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "question": "Who's behind Brisa, and how do I reach you?",
            "answer": "<p>Brisa is a small team, and you deal with real people. Email us at <a href=\"mailto:admin@brisabetter.com\">admin@brisabetter.com</a> or DM us on Instagram and a person replies 24hours. Got a problem with your order, your flavour or your airflow? Send your order number and we'll work it out with you. Behind Brisa is a family team with over 100k and a year of R&D instead into helping people with the bad habit no one should be stuck with.</p>"
